---
description: FastAPI backend standards — apply when fastapi in pyproject/requirements detected (Deduped split)
globs:
  - "**/main.py"
  - "**/api/**/*.py"
  - "**/routers/**/*.py"
  - "**/app/**/*.py"
  - "pyproject.toml"
  - "requirements*.txt"
alwaysApply: false
---

# FastAPI (detect: `fastapi` in `pyproject.toml` / `requirements*.txt`)

- Surface `backend`. `APIRouter` + Pydantic models/schemas — keep business logic out of routes.
- DB = SQLAlchemy/ORM or parameterized — no string concat SQL.
- Auth = deps (`Depends`) + role/scope checks (prevent IDOR). Secrets = env/settings — no hardcode.
- Validation = Pydantic bounds. Docs = preserve OpenAPI schema.
- Test = `pytest` if present per Testing Gate (`07`).
